# Local AI assistant workspace. The memory notes ARE committed on purpose: they
# carry the project context (gotchas, conventions, past decisions) that the next
# agent or session needs to pick up without re-deriving it. Everything else in
# here is regenerable or transient -- screenshots are binary debug artifacts
# (~1.8MB) and caches churn on every run.
.workbuddy/*
!.workbuddy/memory/
